  "title": "Spain El Gordo",
  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1729\" class=\"elementor elementor-1729\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5eef765f elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"78012\" data-id=\"5eef765f\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-243fabee\" data-eae-slider=\"78135\" data-id=\"243fabee\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-482751fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"482751fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"894\" height=\"427\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/el-gordo.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5828\" alt=\"el gordo\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/el-gordo.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/el-gordo-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/el-gordo-768x367.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 894px) 100vw, 894px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"></figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5d60c9 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"91654\" data-id=\"5d60c9\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-59895dee\" data-eae-slider=\"38603\" data-id=\"59895dee\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49af9398 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"49af9398\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About the El Gordo Lottery\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-53f7987b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"82316\" data-id=\"53f7987b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-499fe9ad\" data-eae-slider=\"26054\" data-id=\"499fe9ad\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27af5f7b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"27af5f7b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">El Gordo, also known as the Spanish Christmas Lottery, is an annual draw by the Lotería Nacional. It happens every 22nd of December and is one of the biggest in the world. Each year, millions of tickets are sold, making it the most popular as well.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The </span><b>El Gordo lottery numbers' </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">announcement occurs in Madrid and is broadcast on Spanish and English speaking media. It's a tradition for those who attend the draw in person to dress up in clothes and hats that are lottery-related. Two large cages are used to hold the numbered balls. One cell has the ticket numbers, and the other holds the prize.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In addition to the</span><b> El Gordo lottery results </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">being announced, many smaller prizes are also given to players. Over 1700 balls are drawn for this, and tickets ending in specific numbers are refunded. Due to the number of tickets being rewarded, the chances of winning anything are much higher than other types of lotteries. </span></p><p><br /><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The </span><b>El Gordo lottery winners </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">usually donate to the San Ildefonso school. The students participate by singing the result every year. The reason for giving the money is to help this institution for orphans of public servants. It's a lovely gesture that adds to the Christmas joy.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-59dd3883 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"91763\" data-id=\"59dd3883\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-27e7a301\" data-eae-slider=\"88804\" data-id=\"27e7a301\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-478bbff7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"478bbff7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">El Gordo Lottery FAQ</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4a546a3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible\" data-eae-slider=\"86572\" data-id=\"4a546a3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_devices&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-69b0a892\" data-eae-slider=\"20825\" data-id=\"69b0a892\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b57e975 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"b57e975\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-b57e975\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"b57e975\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"who-won-the-biggest-el-gordo-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1901\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Who won the biggest El Gordo lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1901\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"who-won-the-biggest-el-gordo-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Multiple people can buy the winning ticket because the same number gets sold many times. Due to this system, there’s no single winner that can be identified.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"on-what-channel-is-the-lottery-shown\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1902\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">On what channel is the lottery shown?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1902\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"on-what-channel-is-the-lottery-shown\"><p><b>Results of </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">the</span><b> El Gordo lottery </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">are announced on several different channels. You can watch or listen to the draw on Televisión Española, Radio Nacional de España, and other media outlets.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-you-win\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1903\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How do you win?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1903\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-you-win\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">All you have to do is buy from any officially licensed outlet that sells the tickets. Some people enter </span><b>El Gordo </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">by using a</span><b> lottery app </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">or website. Due to the high number of participants, the odds are currently 1:100,000.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-you-play-the-el-gordo-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1904\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How do you play the El Gordo lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1904\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-you-play-the-el-gordo-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">It's quite simple to enter. You can buy your ticket online or from an authorized shop for €200. Those who can't pay that much, there's an option to get a one-tenth stub for €20, but that means you'll only get a tenth of the prize. </span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">All that's left to do is wait for the draw and see if your number wins. There are many prizes, so even if you don't get the grand prize, you might still receive something.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-draw\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1905\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When is the draw?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1905\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-draw\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The </span><b>lottery</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> draw for </span><b>El Gordo </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">happens every year on the 22nd of December.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-does-the-mega-millions-drawing-take-place\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1906\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When does the mega millions drawing take place?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1906\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"when-does-the-mega-millions-drawing-take-place\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The grand prize drawing takes place during the ceremony. Once the numbers are announced, they're broadcast everywhere immediately.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-does-the-second-chance-lottery-work\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1907\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How does the second chance lottery work?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1907\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"how-does-the-second-chance-lottery-work\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Due to it being a different kind of </span><b>lottery, El Gordo </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">doesn't have a second chance draw. Thousands of prizes with different values are given to ticket holders that didn't win the jackpot.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"is-there-a-voucher-for-the-el-gordo-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1908\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Is there a voucher for the El Gordo Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1908\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"is-there-a-voucher-for-the-el-gordo-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">There's no voucher, but players can buy a piece of a ticket for a portion of a prize if they win.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-i-cash-in-winnings-from-the-el-gordo-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1909\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How do I cash in winnings from the El Gordo lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1909\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"9\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-i-cash-in-winnings-from-the-el-gordo-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you are playing from another country its best to use the </span><b>El Gordo lottery ticket scanner</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> to check or confirm your winnings.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1332ad67 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"32564\" data-id=\"1332ad67\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b0e1402\" data-eae-slider=\"29004\" data-id=\"b0e1402\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a46f84d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a46f84d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the <b>El Gordo </b>Lottery? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-70fa7b85\" data-eae-slider=\"757\" data-id=\"70fa7b85\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a76656b elementor-align-center elementor-button-success elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"6a76656b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t